# Chapters 1-10
growing_villages.chapter.chapter.01.foundation.title=The First Fire
growing_villages.chapter.chapter.01.foundation.intro=The bell gathered those who still remember the road home.
growing_villages.chapter.chapter.02.field.title=A Field That Remembers
growing_villages.chapter.chapter.02.field.intro=The land waits for hands, not promises.
growing_villages.chapter.chapter.03.forge.title=The Forge Returns
growing_villages.chapter.chapter.03.forge.intro=The forge fire serves the common work again.
growing_villages.chapter.chapter.04.routes.title=Roads on the Map
growing_villages.chapter.chapter.04.routes.intro=A named road is not so easily lost in snow.
growing_villages.chapter.chapter.05.watch.title=The First Watch
growing_villages.chapter.chapter.05.watch.intro=The walls give neighbours time to close the door.
growing_villages.chapter.chapter.06.safe_mine.title=Light in the Mine
growing_villages.chapter.chapter.06.safe_mine.intro=The mine opens slowly: light first, then a step.
growing_villages.chapter.chapter.07.neighbours.title=Windows for Neighbours
growing_villages.chapter.chapter.07.neighbours.intro=An empty house becomes a promise to a future neighbour.
growing_villages.chapter.chapter.08.remembered_places.title=Three Remembered Places
growing_villages.chapter.chapter.08.remembered_places.intro=Old names return together with the stone wall.
growing_villages.chapter.chapter.09.craft_circle.title=The Craft Circle
growing_villages.chapter.chapter.09.craft_circle.intro=Hammer and map work for the same road again.
growing_villages.chapter.chapter.10.safe_roads.title=Roads Kept Safe
growing_villages.chapter.chapter.10.safe_roads.intro=There is life inside the walls worth protecting.
