growing_villages.onboarding.what=§e[Growing Villages]§r Somewhere out there are settlements that grow, if you help them.
growing_villages.onboarding.how=§7You can found your own: craft an §fOracle Bell§7 - five gold ingots, a book, two iron ingots and a lantern - and ring it on level ground.
growing_villages.onboarding.charter=§7And once the village has a cartographer, a §fSurvey Charter§7 (eight paper and a compass) will map the finds around it.
